# Do not build gdb with python support on sanitizer builds that need to be
# consistently applied (read: asan, msan, tsan, ubsan). Python gets built with
# sanitizers enabled, so linking against it requires gdb using the same
# (b/376783614). We'd prefer to avoid building gdb with sanitizers: b/187784639
sys-devel/gdb python
